    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market, this excellent 3 bedroomed semi-detached residence, located in a low-density development within easy walking distance of all amenities in the popular lakeside towns of Ballina & Killaloe - the property represents an ideal starter, down-sizer or investment opportunity for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation to include - Entrance Hall, WC, Lounge, Kitchen/Dining Area, 3 bedrooms - 1 En-Suite, Family Bathroom & Hot Press."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3.72m x 2.15m \r\nLaminated oak timber floor. Carpeted stairs to first floor. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nGuest WC - \r\nIncluded Above. Laminated oak timber floor. WC & WHB. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nLounge - 6.37m x 2.95m \r\n+ 4.42m. x 4.12m. Bright & spacious. Laminated oak timber floor. Wood burning stove in surround fireplace with granite hearth. Bay window. Recessed lighting. Dual aspect windows.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 6.53m x 3.45m \r\nLaminated oak timber floor. Fully fitted country cream units to include oven, gas hob, extractor & dishwasher. Plumbed for washing machine & dryer. French door access to rear garden. Strip lighting.\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.95m x 1.06m \r\nCarpeted. Attic access. Fully shelved hotpress with immersion.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.89m x 2.55m \r\nCarpeted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.37m x 2.55m \r\nCarpeted.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 3 - 3.76m x 3.38m \r\nCarpeted. Bay window. TV point.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.31m x 0.99m \r\nVinyl floor & fully tiled around shower area. Electric shower, WC & WHB. \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 2.94m x 1.76m \r\nVinyl floor & fully tiled around bath area. Head shower unit over bath, WC & WHB . Porthole window feature. Shelf unit.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Mains gas central heating. Mains water & sewerage.\r\nPVC Double glazed windows & rear entrance doors. Hardwood front entrance door. \r\nTarmacadam driveway with off-street parking for 2 cars.\r\nLow maintenance front & rear gardens - Enclosed rear garden with timber & corrugated garden sheds.\r\nBuilt in 2003."
      },
      {
